xournal-sharp (1.4.2~gtk4-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Tabs: several documents in one window, each with its own undo history and
    scroll position.
  * The documents open last time open again at start; drafts of unsaved
    documents survive a crash.
  * Autosave interval in seconds (default 10 s); bottom bar across the full
    width.
  * Vertical toolbars: arrows next to the icons, all five pen thicknesses; fix
    sidebar previews and a crash.

