xournal-sharp (1.4.1~gtk4-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Open Saber notes (.sba) and export to Saber: strokes with pressure,
    highlighter, images, PDF backgrounds, background patterns and typed text.
  * Save files as format version 4 when possible, so that Xournal++ 1.3 opens
    them without warning.

 -- Cyrill Valentini <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:15:00 +0100

xournal-sharp (1.4.0~gtk4-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First release of Xournal# on GTK 4 and libadwaita (based on the Xournal++
    GTK 4 port by Benjamin Hennion).
  * libadwaita window, header bar and alert dialogs; accent colour for the page
    border and selections; sidebar, zoom bar and colour palette in GNOME style.
  * Own name, icon and settings; installs alongside the regular Xournal++.
  * Fix PDF export of links with non-ASCII URLs.

 -- Cyrill Valentini <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:30:00 +0100
